# The owner's paths: a PR that touches one waits for @nycruslan, who merges the team's (they're under
# the owner's login) with the ruleset's bypass and approves anyone else's. GitHub reads this
# file from the PR's base branch. The `gate` check and the team's file guard read it too
# (.studio/scope.mjs), matching without regard to case. The last matching line wins, so a line
# with no owner gives that path back to the team.

# The owner's facts; drafts are the team's, for the owner to approve.
/content/ @nycruslan
/content/drafts/

